# battle.mml -- a fast, driving original loop in A minor (contrast to town's calm C major)
speed 6

inst lead
  vol 15 13 11 10 | 10
  duty 2
inst bass
  vol 15 12 9 7 | 7
inst kick
  noise 1
  vol 15 10 5 0
inst snare
  vol 15 11 6 3 0
inst hat
  vol 9 3 0

drum k kick 30
drum s snare 50
drum h hat 70

ch0 lead  o4 a8 >c8 e8 d8  <a8 >c8 <a8 f8  g8 >c8 e8 <c8  g8 b8 >d8 <g8
ch2 bass  o2 [a8 a8]2  [f8 f8]2  [c8 c8]2  [g8 g8]2
ch3 drums [k8 h8 s8 h8]4
